    1,
    9
   ],
   [
    15,
    7,
    13,
    5
   ]
  ],
  "brightness_sold": "the light pools stop revealing; only the lantern does",
  "finale": "as PIXELS die every enemy draws only its eyes; the Gloam already is its eyes in the dark",
  "aim": "Wick auto-aims at the nearest enemy whether it is revealed or not: shots fly into the dark at the eyes, and the hit flash shows the shape for a frame"
 },
